  "body": "Refs #251\nDirect-PR: operator decision 2026-11-05 (confirmed to the steward in session): the first beta ships at M4 close, so LOT-161 moves from M1 to M4. Docs and generated plan data only, self-merged when CI is green.\n\nWhat changed: `docs/LOTS.md` (LOT-161 row and MVP paragraph), `docs/ROADMAP.md` (M1 scope), `tooling/roadmap/generate.py` (M1 set), regenerated `lots.json` and `milestones.json`, and the README table (M1 40 of 40, M4 1 of 23). The #166 and #324 bodies follow once merged.\n\nTests: `scripts/tests/test_roadmap.py` passes.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEBkjmFApUaMrewUvD)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated milestone totals: M1 now lists 40 of 40 lots, and M4 lists 1 of 23.\n  * LOT-161 is no longer designated as part of the MVP; it is scheduled for M4, with its first beta planned for the end of that milestone.\n  * Added LOT-184 to M5 and updated the roadmap to record the M1 scope decision.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
