le(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Change LOT-054 model assignment** <br> `tooling/roadmap/lots.json`|LOT-054’s model assignment changes from Sonnet → Opus to Opus → Fable.|\n\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n**Estimated code review effort:** 2 (Simple) | ~10 minutes\n\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"17162702ed14732e9d6cdf0d5f260b234764dba7\" -->\n**Change:** Other\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n\n**Possibly related issues**\n- ezzz/HFRnow#324 — Tracks the M4 milestone board, which is affected by moving LOT-161 to M4.\n- ezzz/HFRnow#166 — Tracks M1 scope, which changes when LOT-161 leaves M1.\n- ezzz/HFRnow#251 — Tracks LOT-161, whose milestone assignment and roadmap status change.\n\n**Possibly related PRs**\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#369](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/369) — Introduced the roadmap generator and milestone membership data changed by this PR.\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#371](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/371) — Listed LOT-161 as an MVP lot; this PR removes that designation.\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#412](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/412) — Changed LOT-054’s model routing, which this PR records in the roadmap data.\n\n**Suggested labels:** `direct-pr`\n\n**Suggested reviewers:** `claude`\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-low-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Low</strong> · up to <code>17162</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **🔵 Low** · up to `17162`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"17162702ed14732e9d6cdf0d5f260b234764dba7\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"17162702ed14732e9d6cdf0d5f260b234764dba7\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nRelease documentation is inconsistent, but the correction is localized and does not affect runtime behavior.\n<!-- f